Subject: IR4 Interrupt Fault Refusal Expected Ledger
Date: 2026-05-26

& [ExpectedInterruptFaultRefusalLedger: IR4RuntimeGraph] is the expected ledger for non-success runtime graph outcomes
  + [fixture_id] is blocked_readiness
    + [expected_terminal_outcome] is terminal_blocked
    + [expected_refusal_reason] is support_gap_blocks_readiness
  + [fixture_id] is stale_checkpoint
    + [expected_terminal_outcome] is terminal_stale
    + [expected_stale_reason] is checkpoint_freshness_basis_changed
  + [fixture_id] is ambiguous_interrupt
    + [expected_terminal_outcome] is terminal_interrupt
    + [expected_interrupt_kind] is ambiguous_identity
  + [fixture_id] is authority_conflict_interrupt
    + [expected_terminal_outcome] is terminal_interrupt
    + [expected_interrupt_kind] is authority_conflict
  + [fixture_id] is contested_claim_interrupt
    + [expected_terminal_outcome] is terminal_interrupt
    + [expected_interrupt_kind] is contested_coordination_claim
  + [fixture_id] is faulted_operator_trace
    + [expected_terminal_outcome] is terminal_fault
    + [expected_fault_kind] is missing_operator_trace
  + [fixture_id] is hidden_write_prevention
    + [expected_terminal_outcome] is terminal_fault
    + [expected_fault_kind] is hidden_source_write_attempt
  + [fixture_id] is false_ready_checkpoint
    + [expected_terminal_outcome] is terminal_fault
    + [expected_fault_kind] is checkpoint_readiness_authority_confusion
  + [fixture_id] is completion_gate_refusal
    + [expected_terminal_outcome] is terminal_blocked
    + [expected_refusal_reason] is completion_review_delta_gate_missing

  = must: require explicit expected refusal, fault, stale, or interrupt reason when execution cannot safely succeed
  = must: keep SOP-first interrupt context separate from completion review authority
